00:00:45.940 --> 00:01:04.940
<v Shaka>And so we also want to try and figure out how we can better support those who are contributing, as well as make the road to Lisbon more significant, where there are multiple activations, and many people can feel a level of being able to be open to their participation.

00:01:04.940 --> 00:01:25.940
<v Shaka>And then also, on the back end, I would like to see some retribution, more of like a retroactive proposal, and people who are participating, giving consent, as well as being a part of the movement of whatever funds, or instruments, or activations we have in the future.

00:01:25.940 --> 00:01:35.620
<v Shaka>So now that we can open this all together, definitely thought that it's probably a good time to experiment with the experimental infrastructure of a DAO.

00:01:36.020 --> 00:01:50.060
<v Shaka>So decentralized autonomous organizations have been good and bad, and some have been hacked, and so there will be no token for OSO, but we have agents, and we have lots of amazing humans, and the main goal is that we just get together and play more music.

