<v Shaka>So that's what's beautiful about Open Source Orchestra so far, and there are many people who are part of this, and really are holding this space just like wherever they are, because we just take our instruments and our hearts, and that's really just like where this is sourced from.

00:02:08.240 --> 00:02:18.680
<v Shaka>So that's the main source of liquidity that we have as the creative musicians in the Ethereum community, is that we don't need a VC to back us, we can just show up anywhere and start playing music.

00:02:19.280 --> 00:02:35.240
<v Shaka>And we have done that, and we will continue to do that, and now I'd like to see more of a flagship of it coming together, where the orchestra arrives, and we realize that we are there together, and we don't take three days of Devcon to get there, we show up there.

00:02:35.240 --> 00:03:00.320
